sequenceDiagram
    participant SAC as safeApiCall
    participant RF as Retrofit Api
    participant BK as Backend
    SAC->>RF: suspend search(q)
    RF->>BK: HTTP GET
    BK-->>RF: 503 / timeout / no network
    RF-->>SAC: HttpException or IOException
    SAC->>SAC: toAppError(throwable)
    SAC-->>SAC: Outcome.Failure(AppError)
